  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "詩史互證：三曹詩中的歷史與社會",
    "sub_ename": "POETRY AND HISTORY: HISTORY AND SOCIETY IN SAN CAO'S POETRY",
    "describe_ch": "漢末建安時期是個動亂的時代，此時出現了身兼政治家與文學家的曹氏父子：曹操、曹丕、曹植。曹操為一代霸主，四處征戰，奠定了魏國政權。曹丕與曹植早年感情融洽，然而在嗣位之爭時，曹丕取得太子之位，成為魏代開國君王，而曹植為成政治的失意者。曹氏父子以其如椽大筆，書寫當時的社會現象，同時也將自己的遠大抱負、生命境遇，寫入其中。\n閱讀三曹父子的詩文，可以明白其時代背景，以及當時人們共同的歷史記憶。\n",
    "describe_eh": "The Jian'an period at the end of the Han Dynasty was a time of turmoil, when the Cao family - Cao Cao, Cao Pi, and Cao Zhi - emerged as both statesmen and literati. Cao Cao was a dominant figure in his own right, and his conquests led to the establishment of the state of Wei. Cao Pi and Cao Zhi had a close relationship in their early years, but during the struggle for the throne, Cao Pi became the crown prince and the founding king of the Wei dynasty, while Cao Zhi became a political disappointment. Cao Pi and Cao Zhi became the founding kings of the Wei Dynasty, while Cao Zhi became a political disappointment. The Cao father and son wrote about the social phenomena of the time, as well as their own ambitions and life situations, with the same brushwork. Reading the poems of the three Cao's father and son, one can understand the background of their time and the common historical memory of the people at that time.",
